Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: kylin ai document qa service.
  kylin-ai-document-qa-service is a service for Fuzzy search,
  which encapsulates the relevant Python interfaces in C++.
  It is used for fuzzy search requests in various scenarios of the
  corresponding operating system

